WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
Crouching medium punch starts the near-corner confirm.

2
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.850
The medium-to-heavy target cancels into OD Sprint.

3
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:02.500
The OD Arc Step keeps Ryu available for the kick follow-up.

4
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.350
The kick sends Ryu toward the wall.

5
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:04.600
Sprint’s light-kick launcher extends the juggle.

6
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.400
Light Vagabond Edge finishes the juggle.

7
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:05.800
Ryu lands near the wall after the nine-hit conversion.
